 r←Test_Load_210(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;tempPath;parms;msg;rc;qdmx;buff
⍝ Creates a Cider project "#.Foo.NotEmptyNS" and then tries to load the package "APLTreeUtils2" into #.Foo
⍝ Must throw an error because that's not a legal operation. Was once a bug
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 :If 9≠⎕SE.⎕NC'Cider'
     r←T._NotApplicable ⋄ →0
 :EndIf

 tempPath←F.GetTempSubDir'APLTreeUtils2'
 parms←⎕SE.Cider.CreateCreateProjectParms tempPath
 #.⎕SHADOW'Foo' ⋄ 'Foo'#.⎕NS'' ⋄ 'APLTreeUtils2'#.Foo.⎕NS'' ⋄ #.Foo.APLTreeUtils2.a←1
 parms.namespace←'#.Foo'
 ⎕SE.Cider.CreateProject parms
 :Trap 0
     buff←⎕SE.Tatin.LoadPackages(##.CiderConfig.HOME,'/TestData\aplteam-APLTreeUtils2-1.4.1.zip')'#.Foo'
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1
 :Else
     qdmx←⎕DMX
     →T.GoToTidyUp 0=∨/'<#.Foo.APLTreeUtils2> exists but is neither a package nor empty'⍷qdmx.EM
 :EndTrap

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 (rc msg)←F.RmDirByForce tempPath
 msg Assert 0=rc
⍝Done
